Number of ways to write 2*n - 1 = 2*p + q with p, q, phi(p+1) - 1 and phi(p+1) + 1 all prime, where phi(.) is Euler's totient function.

The 70 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A237168

